WEBVTT - PolyLance 30-Second Intro

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
PolyLance is a decentralized freelance marketplace built on Polygon.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:10.000
When a project begins, client funds are locked in a non-custodial smart contract escrow.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:15.000
Freelancers work with confidence knowing milestone payment is fully secured on-chain.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:20.000
Once deliverables are approved, funds release instantly with a low 2.5% platform fee.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:25.000
Every completed milestone mints an immutable Soulbound work certificate to your wallet.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:30.000
Any dispute is judged transparently by on-chain peer arbitrators on JudgeDAO.
